[
  {
    "id": "function-class-redeclaration-iteration",
    "title": "Function and class redeclaration iteration",
    "default": false,
    "task": "验证 PTC 模式中的函数和类迭代修改。第一步只调用一个 run_code cell，声明名为 {{functionName}} 的 function 和名为 {{className}} 的 class，不要依赖声明前使用，也不要返回值。第二步只调用一个新的 run_code cell，先同名重新声明这两个 function/class（先声明再使用），让 function 返回 `new-function`，让 class 实例方法返回 `new-class`，最后 return `${{{functionName}}()}-${new {{className}}().value()}`。第三步直接调用一个新的 run_code cell，不要重新发送任何声明，return 同名 function 和 class 的新实现结果。不要使用 edit_run_code，不要重复发送 setup 源码，最终只报告 `new-function-new-class`。",
    "expect": {
      "minCells": 3,
      "maxCells": 4,
      "allowedJournalStatuses": ["durable"],
      "requiredJournalStatuses": ["durable"],
      "requiredDirectToolSequence": ["run_code", "run_code", "run_code"],
      "requiredSourceCellSequence": [
        { "includes": ["function {{functionName}}", "class {{className}}"] },
        { "includes": ["function {{functionName}}", "class {{className}}"] },
        {
          "includes": ["return", "{{functionName}}", "{{className}}"],
          "excludes": ["function {{functionName}}", "class {{className}}"]
        }
      ],
      "completionEqualsAny": ["new-function-new-class"],
      "finalAnswerIncludes": ["new-function-new-class"],
      "runtimeContexts": {
        "allowed": [],
        "requiredTransitions": [],
        "maxSnapshotChars": 8192
      },
      "machineBudget": {
        "maxModelRequests": 6,
        "maxDirectCalls": 4,
        "maxSourceChars": 12000,
        "maxRepeatedSourceCalls": 0,
        "maxResultChars": 30000,
        "maxAssistantChars": 30000,
        "maxTokenTraffic": 80000,
        "maxRuntimeContextChars": 20000
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "rejected-cell-editing",
    "title": "Completed and rejected cell delta repair",
    "default": true,
    "task": "严格验证 edit transport。不要创建 todo 或计划，不要调用任何无关工具，不要并行或重试；唯一允许的工具活动是严格按 run_code、edit_run_code、run_code、edit_run_code 顺序各调用一次。先把下面第一段源码原样作为一个 run_code cell 执行，不要缩短其中字符串：\n\n{{completedSource}}\n\n它会成功执行，但结果需要微调；只调用一次 edit_run_code，用唯一 literal edit 把 {{adjustmentOld}} 替换为 {{adjustmentNew}}，不要用 run_code 重发修改后源码。然后把下面第二段源码原样作为新的 run_code cell 执行，不要提前修正：\n\n{{rejectedSource}}\n\n它被拒绝后，只调用一次 edit_run_code，用唯一 literal edit 把 {{repairOld}} 替换为 {{repairNew}}，仍然不要用 run_code 重发修改后源码。edit 参数和最终回答都不得包含任一完整源码。最终只报告两次 edit 执行返回的 {{expectedAdjustment}} 和 {{expectedRepair}}。",
    "expect": {
      "minCells": 4,
      "maxCells": 4,
      "allowedJournalStatuses": [
        "noop",
        "durable"
      ],
      "requiredJournalStatuses": [
        "noop",
        "durable"
      ],
      "allowedDiagnosticCodes": [
        "PTC-C001"
      ],
      "requiredDirectToolSequence": [
        "run_code",
        "edit_run_code",
        "run_code",
        "edit_run_code"
      ],
      "editTransports": [
        {
          "originalSource": "{{completedSource}}",
          "oldString": "{{adjustmentOld}}",
          "newString": "{{adjustmentNew}}",
          "repairedSource": "{{adjustedSource}}",
          "targetStatus": "durable"
        },
        {
          "originalSource": "{{rejectedSource}}",
          "oldString": "{{repairOld}}",
          "newString": "{{repairNew}}",
          "repairedSource": "{{repairedSource}}",
          "targetStatus": "noop"
        }
      ],
      "completionIncludes": [
        "{{expectedAdjustment}}",
        "{{expectedRepair}}"
      ],
      "finalAnswerIncludes": [
        "{{expectedAdjustment}}",
        "{{expectedRepair}}"
      ],
      "runtimeContexts": {
        "allowed": [],
        "requiredTransitions": [],
        "maxSnapshotChars": 8192
      },
      "machineBudget": {
        "maxModelRequests": 6,
        "maxDirectCalls": 4,
